Review this agent loop. What is the most important bug?

```python
while True:
    resp = client.messages.create(model=m, max_tokens=1024, tools=tools, messages=msgs)
    text = ''.join(b.text for b in resp.content if b.type == 'text')
    if 'DONE' in text:
        break
    for b in resp.content:
        if b.type == 'tool_use':
            msgs.append({'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': b.id, 'content': run(b)}]})
```
